              Schwabe, John and Barroso, In{\^e}s and Trembath, Richard and
              Wareham, Nicholas and Nagy, Laszlo and Gurnell, Mark and
              O'Rahilly, Stephen and Chatterjee, Krishna",
  abstract = "Summary PPAR$\gamma$ is essential for adipogenesis and metabolic
              homeostasis. We describe mutations in the DNA and ligand binding
              domains of human PPAR$\gamma$ in lipodystrophic, severe insulin
              resistance. These receptor mutants lack DNA binding and
              transcriptional activity but can translocate to the nucleus,
              interact with PPAR$\gamma$ coactivators and inhibit coexpressed
              wild-type receptor. Expression of PPAR$\gamma$ target genes is
