                 identifed by morphological similarity were validated by
                 independent experiments as novel protein-protein and gene
                 regulatory interactions. CONCLUSIONS: A morphometric approach
                 in adipocytes can resolve multiple cellular mechanisms for
                 metabolic disease loci; this approach enables mechanistic
                 interrogation of the hundreds of metabolic disease loci whose
