              Furthermore, a new MetS qualitative definition was proposed by
              replacing fasting plasma glucose with HbA1c > 5.7\% in the
              International Diabetes Federation (IDF) definition. The clinical
              performance of these two MetS criteria (IDF and IDF-modified
              including HbA1c as the dysglycemia indicator) to predict vascular
